{start_of_verse label="Verse 1"}
[G]Old MacDonald [C]had a [G]farm,
[G]E-I-[D]E-I-[G]O!
And [G]on that farm he [C]had a [G]cow,
[G]E-I-[D]E-I-[G]O!
With a [G]moo-moo here and a moo-moo there,
Here a moo, there a moo, everywhere a moo-moo,
[G]Old MacDonald [C]had a [G]farm,
[G]E-I-[D]E-I-[G]O!
{end_of_verse}

